Subject: Re: [stan-dev] LKJ Bijection
Message-ID: <atGbYFCVGxg.09AUTLlx1d4J@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <atGbYFCVGxg.3_S900nr-YUJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
