Andrew and Bob,

Might this be possible using Travis? I’m no expert on Travis, but running a Stan program can be initiated from make.
GitHub does support private repositories for sensitive data. In those cases extra steps might be needed for Travis.

Bob,

Did you get Shashi’s email from July 2nd, that included Shashi’s code? I certainly got that running.
But as you mentioned, the Stan team is ‘stronger’ in C++, R and Python so leaning in that direction makes sense.

Regards,
Rob

